<translate>
==== WeightReduction ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
The parameter sets a modifier for reducing the perceived weight of items that are in this ItemContainer.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
WeightReduction = 30,
</syntaxhighlight>
</translate>

